{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>So all those counted of the children of Israel, by their fathers' houses, from twenty years old and upward.</b> Some have explained that this verse comes to say that the children of Israel were not counted at twenty exactly, but from twenty and upward; and afterward it returns and says, ״ויהיו כל הפקודים שש מאות אלף וגו׳״ — 'So all those counted were six hundred thousand, etc.' — for it stated how many they were." "<b>It is also fitting</b> to say, regarding the fact that he mentioned ויהיו twice: the first is the coming-into-being of the number, and the second is the coming-into-being of permanence and enduring existence. For because the evil eye holds sway over a count, therefore permanence was invoked for them. For thus we find the language of הויה in the account of Creation regarding things that endure, such as light and the soul of man — as it is written (Genesis 1:3): ״ויהי אור״ — 'and there was light' — and it is written (ibid. [1:2]?): ״ויהי האדם לנפש חיה״ — 'and the man became a living soul.' For therefore it repeated the language of הויה together with the created thing itself, to declare that He ordained in them permanence forever, as the saying of the prophet, peace be upon him (Jeremiah 31:35): ״כה אמר ה' נותן שמש לאור יומם חקות ירח וכוכבים לאור לילה וגו׳״ — 'Thus says YHWH, who gives the sun for light by day, the ordinances of the moon and stars for light by night, etc.' — and afterward it is written: ״אם ימושו החקים האלה מלפני וגו׳ גם זרע ישראל ישבתו מהיות גוי לפני כל הימים״ — 'If these ordinances depart from before Me, etc., then the seed of Israel shall also cease from being a nation before Me for all days.'"], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {1 "The citation '(שם ב)' — 'ibid. 2' — appears to refer to Genesis 1:2, but the verse quoted, ויהי האדם לנפש חיה, is actually Genesis 1:24 (or Aramaic והות אדם לנפש חיה in the Targum of 1:20). The citation as printed seems misplaced; translated as written."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:29:39.239036813Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}